Copyright 2026 GetMCPAds

This product includes software developed at GetMCPAds (https://www.getmcpads.com).

An open-source Model Context Protocol server for the Amazon Ads API.
It is self-hosted and unaffiliated with Amazon.

GetMCPAds also runs a managed gateway that covers Amazon Ads alongside
Meta Ads, Google Ads, TikTok Ads, Pinterest Ads, X Ads, Google Analytics and
Search Console, with hosted connections and cross-platform reporting:
https://www.getmcpads.com

src/amazon/contracts/ contains request schemas derived from Amazon's public
Amazon Ads API OpenAPI specifications: structure only, without Amazon's
description text. See src/amazon/contracts/README.md.

